Subject: [PATCH] Upgrade protobuf, gRPC, and related dependencies

Upgrade protobuf to 29.6 and gRPC to 1.69.0, together with their
compatible dependencies, source adaptations, and runtime fixes.
Keep the gRPC migration in sync with libgrpc to avoid ABI breakage:
https://github.com/conda-forge/ray-packages-feedstock/issues/136

